MinGW-w64 (MSYS2 UCRT64) compatibility changes for NWChem 7.3.1 and Global Arrays 5.9.2.
prepare.sh applies them after NWChem's own Global Arrays preparation (get-tools-github); see
installation/nwchem_mingw64.md on https://hnakada123.github.io/MolForma/. This is not an official
patch of NWChem or Global Arrays, and their developers have not reviewed or endorsed it.

The changed files belong to:
- NWChem (src/util/): Copyright (c) 1994-2020 Pacific Northwest National Laboratory, Battelle
  Memorial Institute. Licensed under the Educational Community License, Version 2.0
  (https://opensource.org/licenses/ECL-2.0).
- Global Arrays 5.9.2 (src/tools/ga-5.9.2/): Copyright Battelle Memorial Institute. Licensed under
  the BSD-3-Clause license (https://opensource.org/licenses/BSD-3-Clause).
Each change is offered under the license of the file it changes. The hunks below list the changed
files and lines.

